      "hasPreReportPracticeReturnDelta": false,
      "isMidWeekAdditionDelta": false,
      "archetypeNote": "",
      "factors": [
        "Cleared without restrictive game-day designation"
      ],
      "beatComment": "Amon-Ra St. Brown and Jahmyr Gibbs monopolized the Lions' offense on the day, scoring four of the team's five TDs, and there wasn't much production left over for Williams. The fifth-year wideout has topped 50 receiving yards just three times this season, and he'll take a 32-518-5 line on 51 targets through nine games into a Week 11 battle with the Buccaneers."
    },
    {
